This Kotlin Multiplatform library combines specification implementations with
ports of permissively licensed image and compression code. Per-codec origins,
reference links and licenses are recorded in reference/REFERENCES.md.

The JPEG 2000, JBIG2, CCITT and MQ decoders include software developed by the
KitePDF authors under the Apache License, Version 2.0. They were adapted from
KitePDF in commit 24bee5954a0e44f09f606400b05446a8380f416c. Their format references
are ITU-T T.800 (JPEG 2000 and MQ), T.88 (JBIG2 and MQ), and T.4/T.6 (CCITT).

The PNG inflate path is an altered Kotlin translation of Mark Adler's puff
(2002-2013), vendored from ArchiveKodec via KiteTorrent and libtorrent. puff is
zlib-licensed; Inflate.kt retains the original copyright and license notice.
The DEFLATE encoder's length-limited Huffman construction follows zlib's trees.c
(Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler). Deflate.kt retains the zlib notice.

The JPEG decoder's arithmetic decoding follows libjpeg-turbo 3.1.0's jdarith.c
(developed 1997-2015 by Guido Vollbeding; libjpeg-turbo modifications Copyright
(C) 2015-2020, 2022, D. R. Commander), and its 12-bit inverse DCT is an altered
Kotlin port of jpeg_idct_islow in libjpeg-turbo 3.1.0's jidctint.c (Copyright
(C) 1991-1998, Thomas G. Lane; modification developed 2002-2018 by Guido
Vollbeding; libjpeg-turbo modifications Copyright (C) 2015, 2020, 2022, D. R.
Commander), both under the Independent JPEG Group's license. This software is
based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.

The porting references include stb_image and stb_image_write (public domain /
MIT), lodepng (zlib), and Apache Commons Imaging (Apache-2.0). Original reference
source trees are used for study and are not redistributed in this repository.

WebP lossless and its container were implemented from Google's WebP
specifications and verified against libwebp's cwebp/dwebp binaries.
The prefix-tree correction additionally consulted libwebp's huffman_utils.c
(BSD-3-Clause).

The lossy WebP decoder (Vp8Decoder.kt) is an altered Kotlin port of libwebp
1.3.2's VP8 decoder and output conversion, and Vp8Tables.kt holds libwebp's
constant tables, generated from its source by tools/vp8_tables.py. Both files
retain libwebp's notice. libwebp is distributed under this license:

